  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: 'A massive flying fortress created in ancient times by the Obscurian people.
    In modern history, Agartha is incorportated as a self-governing city-state of
    Armica.


    The structure of Agartha is a massive, metallic sphere 25 miles in diameter, flanked
    by large wing structures that allow for high-speed flight. The structure is broken
    into several layered strata broken into two halves: the surface layers (broken
    further into Upper Agartha and Lower Agartha), and the subterranean Ruins. '
